	<div id="main" data-framer-hydrate-v2="{&quot;routeId&quot;:&quot;Z7_Caaz4l&quot;,&quot;localeId&quot;:&quot;default&quot;,&quot;pathVariables&quot;:{&quot;QGUjBIECF&quot;:&quot;privacy-policy&quot;},&quot;breakpoints&quot;:[{&quot;hash&quot;:&quot;1xrouo3&quot;,&quot;mediaQuery&quot;:&quot;(min-width: 1200px)&quot;},{&quot;hash&quot;:&quot;1xclhjw&quot;,&quot;mediaQuery&quot;:&quot;(min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px)&quot;},{&quot;hash&quot;:&quot;1r9rumu&quot;,&quot;mediaQuery&quot;:&quot;(max-width: 809.98px)&quot;},{&quot;hash&quot;:&quot;p32ikr&quot;,&quot;mediaQuery&quot;:&quot;(max-width: 809.98px)&quot;},{&quot;hash&quot;:&quot;180nd7t&quot;,&quot;mediaQuery&quot;:&quot;(min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px)&quot;},{&quot;hash&quot;:&quot;e2vlwt&quot;,&quot;mediaQuery&quot;:&quot;(min-width: 1200px)&quot;}],&quot;collectionItemId&quot;:&quot;PPH5kcBkb&quot;}" data-framer-ssr-released-at="2026-08-17T13:04:12.195Z" data-framer-page-optimized-at="2026-08-18T16:05:06.387Z" data-framer-generated-page><!--$--><style data-framer-html-style>:root body { background: var(--token-2a928866-72f1-4d03-8fde-10c5088183f1, rgb(255, 252, 245)); }</style><div class="framer-oDdGQ framer-e2vlwt" data-layout-template="true" style="min-height:100vh;width:auto"><style data-framer-html-style>html body { background: var(--token-2a928866-72f1-4d03-8fde-10c5088183f1, rgb(255, 252, 245)); }</style><div data-framer-root class="framer-esZv8 framer-6VMZ5 framer-xRUl6 framer-3Pfie framer-OcfH4 framer-1xrouo3" style="min-height:100vh;width:auto;display:contents"><main class="framer-1hofpix" data-framer-name="Main"><div class="framer-1kq9wgh" data-framer-name="Container"><div class="framer-1v7i0qv" data-framer-name="Header"><div class="framer-14xovpg" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="transform:none"><h1 class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1pw0103" data-styles-preset="V9ESRO1Y2" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-alignment:center">Privacy Policy</h1></div><div class="framer-gfvjqo" data-framer-name="Last updated"><div class="framer-1xoxyxb" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-s36art" data-styles-preset="bKbUORL5b" dir="auto">Last updated at</p></div><div class="framer-194q4w6" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-s36art" data-styles-preset="bKbUORL5b" dir="auto"><time datetime="2026-04-09T13:42:52.067Z">April 9, 2026</time></p></div></div></div><div class="framer-1984z48" data-framer-name="Content Container"><div class="framer-bs7kyn" data-border="true" data-framer-name="Content Wrapper"><div class="framer-1kxfw4w" data-framer-name="Content" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="transform:none"><h3 dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-l6jq3">Introduction</h3><p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv">This Privacy Policy explains how Pulma collects, uses, and protects your information when you interact with our services or website.</p><h3 dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-l6jq3">Information We Collect</h3><p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv">We may collect the following information:</p><ul dir="auto" class="framer-text"><li data-preset-tag="p" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv">Name and contact details (email, phone number)</p></li><li data-preset-tag="p" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv">Project-related information and communication</p></li><li data-preset-tag="p" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv">Website usage data (via analytics tools)</p></li></ul><p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv">We only collect information that is necessary to provide and improve our services.</p><h3 dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-l6jq3">How We Use Information</h3><p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv">Your information is used to:</p><ul dir="auto" class="framer-text"><li data-preset-tag="p" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv">Communicate and manage projects</p></li><li data-preset-tag="p" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv">Provide and improve our services</p></li><li data-preset-tag="p" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv">Respond to inquiries and requests</p></li><li data-preset-tag="p" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv">Maintain internal records</p></li></ul><p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv">We do not sell or rent your personal data to third parties.</p><h3 dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-l6jq3">Data Protection</h3><p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv">We take reasonable steps to protect your information from unauthorized access, disclosure, or misuse.</p><p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv">However, no method of transmission over the internet is completely secure.</p><h3 dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-l6jq3">Third-Party Services</h3><p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv">We may use trusted third-party tools (e.g., analytics, communication platforms) to support our operations.</p><p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv">These services may collect limited data in accordance with their own privacy policies.</p><h3 dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-l6jq3">Cookies</h3><p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv">Our website may use cookies to improve user experience and analyze traffic.</p><p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv">You can choose to disable cookies through your browser settings.</p><h3 dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-l6jq3">Your Rights</h3><p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv">You may request to:</p><ul dir="auto" class="framer-text"><li data-preset-tag="p" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv">Access the data we hold about you</p></li><li data-preset-tag="p" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv">Correct or update your information</p></li><li data-preset-tag="p" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv">Request deletion of your data</p></li></ul><p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv">Requests can be made through our contact channels.</p><h3 dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-l6jq3">Changes to This Policy</h3><p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv">We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. Any changes will be reflected on this page.</p></div></div></div></div></main><div class="framer-rromaj-container"><!--$--><link href="http://localhost:8765/_assets/unpkg.com/lenis@1.3.23/dist/lenis.css" rel="stylesheet"><!--/$--></div></div><div id="overlay"></div><div class="framer-18jewya"></div><div class="ssr-variant hidden-p32ikr"><div class="framer-1fhfuhy-container"><div class="ssr-variant hidden-180nd7t"><footer class="framer-zokYP framer-6VMZ5 framer-De99c framer-OcfH4 framer-xxCn2 framer-xRUl6 framer-1fovpt3 framer-v-1fovpt3" data-framer-name="Desktop" style="height:100%;width:100%"><div class="framer-18ibqmk" data-framer-name="Container" style="background-color:var(--token-2f5dc462-5cc3-4e49-a215-83e8c88dc35a, rgb(255, 244, 214));border-bottom-left-radius:40px;border-bottom-right-